tar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":28454134,"digest":"sha256:3c6a58f6941224a25ec28de733554743e9b2517c40c76991eef5474f8c1c2c1a","download_count":345,"created_at":"2026-11-04T12:48:25Z","updated_at":"2026-11-04T12:48:27Z"},{"id":709490033,"node_id":"RA_kwDOBJgEXs4qSfVx","name":"goreleaser_Windows_x86_64.zip.sbom.json","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":549023,"digest":"sha256:435b6f72d686a98e0d5fd01db60b36f28e76ccd1eff878ae41ef1e0b675540b4","download_count":4,"created_at":"2026-11-04T12:48:46Z","updated_at":"2026-11-04T12:48:47Z"}],"body":"\n## Announcement\n\nRead the official announcement: [Announcing GoReleaser v2.20](https://goreleaser.com/blog/goreleaser-v2.20/).\n\n\n## Security\n\nGoReleaser v2.20.0 fixes an issue that could write inline publishing SSH private keys in cleartext to `dist/artifacts.json`. Upgrade to v2.20.0 and revoke and replace any keys exposed through shared or uploaded release metadata.\n\nSee [GHSA-9422-8p9m-393x](https://github.com/goreleaser/goreleaser/security/advisories/GHSA-9422-8p9m-393x) for details.\n\n## Changelog\n### New Features\n* e1176e6189ddc4136161a2d00efa0ce0bd43b6a7: feat(cask): render `zap :not_required` when no zap directives are set (#7253) (@SimonMiaou)\n* afd8f84e21e5a26d8dcc215b9e94c2433d6c4bff: feat(gitlab): add asset type selection (#7255) (@mavogel)\n* b8f79e0399c46895220e8479e24d599576b563a8: feat(ko): allow templates in platforms (#7233) (@mrueg and @caarlos0)\n* 2e260e4af35c00e0ad41e479c3830f9cfe858e36: feat(winget): update manifest schema to latest (1.28.0) (#7242) (@abemedia)\n* 4a1a1aecad78b7de77879e6b5e3809b578db000b: feat: allow skipping the changelog with --skip=changelog (#7234) (@mrueg and @caarlos0)\n### Bug fixes\n* 24ec0fd478872716fa2665eafa3380191240359a: fix(bluesky): do not add a link facet when there is no release URL (#7262) (@10kartik)\n* bfa11d921eabfe07480012b5e8d8c5a40f566508: fix(nodedist): handle prerelease versions in generation (#7263) (@caarlos0)\n* 3d5c3a2efe1544b8f7d24a8c2ed10dab45b89a61: fix(tmpl): escape backslashes in mdv2escape (#7261) (@10kartik)\n* e39e2fe8b3b57b589bf89d2e8e1916012846434e: refactor: move marshaljson methods to right place (@caarlos0)\n### Documentation updates\n* 53e5668e405484ca6df9d189edd3a4be47097a63: docs: add --snapshot to quick start single-target builds (#7232) (@dcadolph)\n* 3467d0fee89e5a99d1a12ab9204361bfbbd03896: docs: github app (#7271) (@caarlos0)\n* 81042d32245657ba3e5c29215fa3adbb716bb35d: docs: update Pro page copy (#7270) (@caarlos0)\n* 2d9b4c9ae3a1998975f89be160346255bbdbfbfe: docs: v2.19 announcement and docs (@caarlos0)\n### Other work\n* 6ac29673ac708d7f5a95b37639ff6ad6b8e1c835: Merge commit from fork (@Divsonar and @caarlos0)\n* 94bc1931912b5e25d40ba44aa6172584eef9af7b: chore: auto-update generated files (#7231) (@goreleaserbot)\n* 538a99ed8f8283ed4b47f7f5ba2ab59df049cd64: chore: auto-update generated files (#7254) (@goreleaserbot)\n* 6e4f864373b19007d2bda3ae091721d82750f6fc: chore: auto-update generated files (#7264) (@goreleaserbot)\n* 9b610a1a2a394c3480edb96ae437eff042695b94: chore: auto-update generated files (#7266) (@goreleaserbot)\n* 27f55a04b7c7446612267346c110659bd59f4fbb: chore: lint (@caarlos0)\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/goreleaser/goreleaser/compare/v2.19.0...v2.20.0\n\n\n## Helping out\n\nThis release is only possible thanks to **all** the support of some **awesome people**!\n\nWant to be one of them?\nYou can [sponsor](https://goreleaser.com/sponsors/), get a [Pro License](https://goreleaser.com/pro) or [contribute with code](https://goreleaser.com/contributing).\n\n## Where to go next?\n\n* Find examples and commented usage of all options in our [website](https://goreleaser.com/intro/).\n* Reach out on [Discord](https://discord.gg/RGEBtg8vQ6), [Twitter](https://twitter.com/goreleaser), and [Telegram](https://t.me/goreleasernews)!\n\n<a href=\"https://goreleaser.com\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/goreleaser/artwork/master/opencollective-header.png\" with=\"100%\" alt=\"GoReleaser logo\"></a>\n\n\n\n","reactions":{"total_count":3,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"mentions_count":9}
